  "accepted_answers": ["Liangdao"],
  "explanation": "The question asks for the courtesy name of **Marquis Su**. The original sources clarify that **Marquis Su** is the posthumous title of **Jia Kui**, whose courtesy name is **Liangdao** (梁道). This is directly stated in D2S1 and D2S2, where Jia Kui is described as having the courtesy name Liangdao and the posthumous name Marquis Su. Document D4S1 and D4S3 incorrectly assign the courtesy name **Fengyun** to Jia Kui, but this appears to be a conflicting variant and not aligned with the most consistent and authoritative identification of Jia Kui as Marquis Su. Document D5S1 refers to **Wang Guan**, not Jia Kui, and assigns the courtesy name **Weitai**, which is unrelated to Marquis Su. Therefore, only **Liangdao** is valid as the courtesy name of Marquis Su."
}
